sentences.text:
Parties call for the records and after hearing the parties issue writ/writs in the nature of mandamus/certiorari or any other writ direct the Opp. Party No.3 to refer the objection dtd 20.10.2022 of the petitioner to the authority for determination of the amount of compensation Under Section 64 of the Right to Fair Compensation and Transparency in Land Acquisition,
Rehabilitation and Resettlement Act, 2013, vide Annexure-4 by the petitioner within a stipulated period for the interest of justice;
And the Hon'ble Court may pass any order/direction may be deem fit and proper.

